control: A body the port or the conversion refuses is recorded refused, never scanned, and not fetched again
removes: a tick ignores a rendering refusal, so the body is scanned as empty and recorded clean
packages: ./worker/internal/deltasync
tests: TestNoBodyTextReachesTheIndexOrTheLogs
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

